 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Legal Compliance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Meet anti-bribery legal requirements including the UK Bribery Act, US FCPA, and other international anti-corruption laws.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-star text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Reputation Protection</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Protect your organization&#x27;s reputation by demonstrating a proactive commitment to ethical business practices.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-users text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Stakeholder Confidence</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Build confidence with stakeholders, investors, and partners through independently certified anti-bribery management.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex flex-col justify-center"><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Eurocert?</h3><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Our experienced professionals understand anti-bribery requirements and can guide you through the certification process.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none